5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I’m worried about the depot floor. Freight doesn’t pause for office projects. We need a system that survives our actual yards and calendar.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Kenji, the floor is critical, but I’m watching the long-term bill. We need to know what this system truly costs us after the initial approval.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Kenji, the floor matters, but I’m watching for the same old failure: unclear ownership when things break, and plans that drift from reality.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I keep seeing two bad patterns: systems that just get old, and outside help that leaves a mess. We have to avoid both!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
