78,3,4,talk,Rin,,"@Mizuki, I get the money worry! But remember the 2018 mess? If they leave, we’re stuck with bad data forever. Anchor stays to fix it!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
